    "description": "# Vidya API (student)\n\nLocal: `http://localhost:4000` or your LAN IP from `npm start`\nSame Wi‑Fi teammates: use the printed LAN API URL.\n\n## Setup\n1. Set `studentPassword` from seed (`StudentDemo1!`) — **do not commit secrets**.\n2. Run **Student Auth → login** — token auto-saves.\n3. Student domains: Health, Auth, Curriculum, Materials, Dashboard, Learning, Quizzes, Tasks, Notifications, Exams.\n4. After editing YAML, run `npm run postman:export`.\n\n## Docs\n- Swagger UI: `{{baseUrl}}/docs`\n- OpenAPI JSON: `{{baseUrl}}/docs-json`",
